            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1053-f2" n="30" xml:id="d1053-f2-content">
                <p>Rafael Schiaffino, Minister of Industry and Labor, and Daniel Castellanos,
                    Minister of Public Instruction.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
